      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LADY MARIANA (8) makes her debut with a nice trial at Canberra under her belt. She was meant to debut last week when at the top of betting at Canberra but was scratched with a slight issue. Finds a winnable race again today and can make an immediate impact. REBEL TERRA (6) also has upside after working home evenly for third on debut at Moruya on soft ground. Out to 1100m this time is a big tick and he should be better for the debut effort. Can feature in the finish yet again. COOL AS TED (1) comes through a narrow Cootamundra second and has already placed twice around this distance. Fitter for that effort now and she won't be far away. STEFFIEWAH (2) nearly pinched it at Moruya at long odds and did finish ahead of REBEL TERRA there. That form looks strong for this and she's not to be discounted on the back of that form. ALOTOFSOJU (3) is next best.",
